SUMMARY:Architecting Context-Aware Agents with the Microsoft IQ Stack
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nContext-aware agents depend on a de
 sign that connects knowledge\, enterprise data\, work signals\, and the li
 ve web.\n\nLearn how the Microsoft IQ stack (Foundry IQ\, Fabric IQ\, Work
  IQ\, and Web IQ) provides the enterprise intelligence layer for AI agents
 .\n\nMap each layer onto a reference architecture\, see where each one fit
 s and how they compose\, and learn how to choose the right intelligence fo
 r a given scenario.\n\nBuild a practical foundation for designing scalable
 \, reliable\, context-aware agents.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/microsoft-reactor-toronto/events/3153
 87808/
